<title>THAILAND: National Petrochemical Q3 turns to profit.</title>
<headline>National Petrochemical Q3 turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Profit     N/A	vs   Loss    1.03</p>
<p>    Net	   Profit   107.00     vs   Loss  319.57</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Profit     N/A	vs   Profit   0.90</p>
<p>    Net	   Profit   430.00     vs   Profit 277.30</p>
<p>NOTES: The earning per share not available. Company's full name is National Petrochemical Plc, a petrochemical firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
